    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introduction</h2><br>Lanwmover game where player drive lawnmower and cut grass in big open world which contain grass, houses and other obstacles<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>Drive lawnmover in open world and only job is to cut every cuttable grass in open world. After cutting all grass, it will respawn.<br><br>Lawnmover has also fuel consumption. Pick-up Jerry cans and add fuel. <br>After fuel is empty player will respawn to start location<br>There is score system that player can get score with any grass player has cutted. <br><br>Enjoy the game, cut all grass and be the lawnmower king......",
